        "message": "=💳 <b>Payment match</b> (confidence {{ Math.round($('One Item per Proposed Match').item.json.confidence * 100) }}%)\n<b>Agent:</b> Payments Agent\n<b>Bank line:</b> {{ $('One Item per Proposed Match').item.json.line.LineID }} · {{ $('One Item per Proposed Match').item.json.line.Date }}\n<b>From:</b> {{ $('One Item per Proposed Match').item.json.line.Payer }} · ref \"{{ $('One Item per Proposed Match').item.json.line.Reference }}\"\n<b>Amount:</b> {{ $('One Item per Proposed Match').item.json.line.Currency }} {{ $('One Item per Proposed Match').item.json.line.Amount }}\n<b>Applies to:</b>\n{{ $('One Item per Proposed Match').item.json.allocations.map(a => '• ' + a.OrderID + ' (QBO ' + a.InvoiceID + ', ' + a.CustomerName + '): ' + a.applied + (a.fullyPaid ? ' – paid in full' : ' – PART payment')).join('\\n') }}\n<b>Why:</b> {{ $('One Item per Proposed Match').item.json.reason }}{{ $('One Item per Proposed Match').item.json.issues.length ? '\\n⚠️ ' + $('One Item per Proposed Match').item.json.issues.join('; ') : '' }}\n\nApprove = record the payment in QuickBooks.",
        "responseType": "customForm",
        "defineForm": "fields",
        "formFields": {
          "values": [
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Decision",
              "fieldType": "dropdown",
              "requiredField": true,
